<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport Gurgaon to Mumbai | Safe Auto Carrier
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does a car transport from Gurgaon to Mumbai typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The transit distance of roughly 1,463 km via NH‑19 is covered in 2 to 3 business days under normal traffic conditions. Our hydraulic ramp carriers operate round‑the‑clock, with scheduled overnight secure parking, ensuring your vehicle reaches Mumbai promptly while maintaining zero‑scratch handling.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures protect my vehicle during the Gurgaon‑to‑Mumbai move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We use IBA‑approved multi‑car trailers equipped with hydraulic ramps, wheel chocks, high‑tensile ratchet lashings, and 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging. Every load undergoes a pre‑trip inspection and is monitored by live GPS, guaranteeing zero transit scratches and full compliance with Indian transport regulations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance included in the car transport service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. All shipments are covered by 100 % declared‑value, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance at no extra cost. The policy protects against accidental damage, theft, or natural events throughout the journey from Gurgaon to Mumbai, providing you peace of mind and a clear claim process if needed.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle in real time while it travels to Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Each of our specialized carriers is fitted with a satellite‑enabled GPS unit. Once your car is loaded, you receive a secure tracking link that shows live location, estimated arrival time, and any checkpoint updates, ensuring full transparency from Gurgaon to Andheri.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for a smooth car transport between Gurgaon and Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid vehicle registration certificate, a government‑issued ID, the e‑Way bill generated by our team, and the GST‑compliant invoice. Our IBA‑approved mover code certificate and insurance policy documents are also provided, simplifying reimbursement claims for corporate or government transfers.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does your pricing compare with the cheapest packers and movers in Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While we may not be the absolute lowest price, our transparent cost structure includes all mandatory fees, premium insurance, and zero‑scratch guarantees—features often excluded by the cheapest movers. This all‑inclusive approach eliminates hidden charges and delivers superior value for car transport Gurgaon to Mumbai.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
